{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>PARK. THAT. THING.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to <strong>WIDE LOAD</strong>, the precision parking <i>chaos simulator</i> you never asked for\u2014but absolutely need. Take control of an 18-wheeler and try to wedge, slide, drift, or <i>pray</i>\u00a0into parking spaces that definitely weren't built with you in mind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">\u2757<strong>FEATURES</strong>\u2757</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ridiculous Trailer Handling</strong> \u2013 Long? Bendy?  Yup.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Precision Parking Madness</strong> \u2013 \u201cPerfect parking\u201d or \u201cperfect disaster\u201d \u2014 your choice.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Road and Vehicle Modifiers</strong> \u2013 Oops all\u2026 <i>despair.</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Speedruns?</strong> \u2013 Beat the timer or beat your dignity. Both work.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Crash Physics</strong> \u2013 Spectacular? Yes. Useful? No.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Speed Run Mode</strong> \u2013 Only gameplay for time built into the game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Panic Moments</strong> \u2013 You\u2019ll know when.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Full Controller Support and UI</strong> - We got you controller users!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WIDE LOAD</strong><br>We <i>can\u2019t wait</i> to see what you do with your <strong>WIDE LOAD</strong>.<br><br><strong>Wide Load is a physics-based parking simulator where precision meets chaos.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate tight turns, dodge traffic, and steer your\u00a0\u00a0<i><strong>w i d e\u00a0 l o a d</strong></i><strong>\u00a0</strong> across cliffside roads, hazards, and jumps. Master each level and race the clock to earn the fastest time - if you can park it without crashing first.</p>","backg