ime built into the game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Panic Moments</strong> \u2013 You\u2019ll know when.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Full Controller Support and UI</strong> - We got you controller users!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>WIDE LOAD</strong><br>We <i>can\u2019t wait</i> to see what you do with your <strong>WIDE LOAD</strong>.<br><br><strong>Wide Load is a physics-based parking simulator where precision meets chaos.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Navigate tight turns, dodge traffic, and steer your\u00a0\u00a0<i><strong>w i d e\u00a0 l o a d</strong></i><strong>\u00a0</strong> across cliffside roads, hazards, and jumps. Master each level and race the clock to earn the fastest time - if you can park it without crashing first.</p>","developers":["Black Prism","Ty Conner"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Racing","id":"9"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Sports","id":"18"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/910860/c8f0ed968a718e1b78ab028c3b4470e1488d8707/header.jpg?t=1746562244","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257133627,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133627/movie480.mp4?t=1746561786","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133627/movie_max.mp4?t=1746561786"},"name":"Wishlist Now","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257133627/36885351f7a5945d31e3086d86063982025afc07/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746561786","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133627/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746561786","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133627/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746561786"}}],"name":"Wide Load","package_groups"